{"author":440,"label":"Manas Bakshi","poems":[{"id":712,"source_language":"en","variants":{"en":{"label":"English","title":"Tacitly So","kind":"Original","stanzas":[["With a few dots","On a graph paper","Something`s drawn --"],["Remains outside","A few scrawlings","Abrupt, indistinct","Offering a clue","To an indelible story,"],["Story or narrative about","Some straggling moments","Saddled with the residue","Of three tangible elements:","Some bricks, letters","And trees;"],["Living or non-living","All`re almost the same","When extinct`s","Their tenure on earth!"],["Who bothers","To look backward","And recall","What these were worth?"],["The mason`s fingerprint","No more traceable","On the eroded bricks,"],["Erased also","The scurrying postman`s","Fingermark from","The useless letters","Stacked in","The dead letter office,"],["None cares to think","Of the felled oaks","Incapable of inviting","Rain anymore!"],["Erasable or perishable","Mortal or fragile","Some elements","Of impermanence","Streaked with matching colours","When in earthly existence","Get enwrapped","Today or tomorrow","In an invisible layer of time","In life`s abandoned zone...."],["Witness:","The graph paper alone."]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]},"hi":{"label":"हिन्दी","title":"अनकहे ही","kind":"Translation","stanzas":[["कुछ बिंदुओं से","एक ग्राफ़ काग़ज़ पर","कुछ बनाया गया है—"],["बाहर रह जाते हैं","कुछ घसीटे हुए अक्षर,","अचानक, अस्पष्ट,","एक सुराग देते हुए","किसी अमिट कहानी का,"],["कहानी या वृत्तांत","कुछ बिखरे क्षणों का,","लदे हुए अवशेषों से","तीन मूर्त तत्त्वों के:","कुछ ईंटें, पत्र","और पेड़;"],["सजीव या निर्जीव,","सब लगभग एक जैसे हैं,","जब समाप्त हो जाता है","धरती पर उनका कार्यकाल!"],["कौन परवाह करता है","पीछे मुड़कर देखने की","और याद करने की","कि इनका मूल्य क्या था?"],["राजमिस्त्री की उँगली का निशान","अब मिलता नहीं","घिसी हुई ईंटों पर,"],["मिट गया है","भागते डाकिए की","उँगली का निशान भी","उन बेकार पत्रों से,","जो ढेर हैं","अवितरित पत्र कार्यालय में,"],["कोई सोचता नहीं","काटे गए बलूतों के